  "before_entry": {
    "id": "M26",
    "title_zh": "认知发展与取得的组合解释",
    "title_en": "Cognitive development and acquired compositional interpretation",
    "claim_zh": "实际记录形成组合操作并进入他人的重构与传递；取得的分节、歧义接触所得绑定与组合使用已接通。移动现从同一空间安排产生可取得候选，进入旧绑定解释；保留错误唯一绑定、矛盾、误排来源、无保留及错时序失败。完整认知、学习与演化心理目标继续。",
    "claim_en": "Actual records form compositional operations and enter others’ reconstruction and transmission. Acquired grouping, bindings learned across ambiguous encounters and compositional use are connected. Movement now produces accessible alternatives from one spatial arrangement for the prior binding interpretation. Wrong unique bindings, contradiction, mistaken source exclusion, absent retention and mistiming remain. The full cognitive/evolutionary objective continues.",
    "scope_zh": "取得25项定理／52项审计；构造37／65；传递27／45；分节23／51；绑定23／41；行动场景新增16／29，最新288项继承审计分列。空间关系、范围、分类、已有操作、命名／移动安排及来源判断仍给定。下一连接是产生经历的探究／沟通行动的选择和修订；完整注意、心理、演化对应及意识未完成。",
    "scope_en": "Acquisition: 25 theorems / 52 audits; formation: 37 / 65; transmission: 27 / 45; grouping: 23 / 51; binding: 23 / 41; enacted scenes add 16 / 29, with 288 inherited audits separately rebuilt. Spatial relations, range, categories, known operations, naming/movement schedules and source judgments remain supplied. Next: selection/revision of exploratory and communicative actions producing encounters; broad attention, psychology, evolutionary correspondence and consciousness remain incomplete.",
